<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<PermissionSet xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <label>Device Integration</label>
    <description>Everything the integration user (CLI, CI, MCP, AWS callbacks) needs and nothing more: API access, the device data model, and execute on the service classes. Delete is deliberately withheld everywhere - automation creates and updates, humans delete. Assign on top of the Minimum Access profile; see docs/ACCOUNT-BOOTSTRAP.md.</description>
